I walked slowly on the path.
There were many tall trees on the path.
Suddenly, I heard a loud noise.
I stopped right there and looked ahead.
There was a tourist on the path.
He was engrossed in his own mobile phone.
He did not see the monkey above.
A mischievous monkey jumped from the tree.
The monkey quickly snatched that tourist's hat.
The tourist said loudly, "Hey!"
"My hat!"
But the monkey took his hat and climbed back up the tree.
The monkey sat on a branch of the tree.
I saw this incident.
I quickly looked at my own bag.
I gripped my own bag tightly.
I also put my own water bottle inside the bag.
Then I carefully walked forward.
That tourist was still looking at the monkey.
